      "ImageDescription": {
        "value": "The national holiday \"Tirgon\" in Dushanbe. The celebration took place on June 30, 2024 in the Iram Park in Dushanbe. Tadjikistan.  — This is the Iranian Summer Solstice Festival, which is celebrated annually on the 13th of Tir (month) around July 2-3, 4. Tirgon (Tirgan) — an ancient Iranian tradition, which is still celebrated by Iranian-speaking peoples in the countries of the <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/European_Union\" title=\"European Union\">European Union</a>, <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Iran\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Iran\">Iran</a>, <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Canada\" title=\"Canada\">Canada</a>, <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/USA\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"USA\">USA</a>, <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Tajikistan\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tajikistan\">Tajikistan</a>",
